                                          "Carrying the film",
                                          "c",
                                          "Decorating the camera",
                                          "d",
                                          "Zooming digitally"
                                      ],
                          "correctOption":  null,
                          "explanation":  null,
                          "topic":  "Focus"
                      },
                      {
                          "id":  8,
                          "questionText":  "Why does old film darken where light falls on it?",
                          "options":  [
                                          "a",
                                          "Because it is painted black",
                                          "b",
                                          "Because it rusts",
                                          "c",
                                          "Because it melts",
                                          "d",
